<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Reece buys Plumbing assets.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Reece buys Plumbing assets.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1996-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Building supply firm Reece Australia Ltd said on Friday it would buy the Plumbing World division of Plumbing World Ltd for about A$7.5 million.</p>
<p>Reece said the assets to be acquired are stock, fixed assets and the Plumbing World name and trademark.</p>
<p>The agreement is subject to approval by Plumbing World shareholders, the change of Plumbing World's name to Mining World Ltd, and satisfactory completion of a due diligence review.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
